  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Soomaliya oo Nabad ah: Building Inclusive Early Warning &amp; Early Response Systems at the Community Level</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the action is to enhance the effectiveness of conflict prevention and peacebuilding processes through establishing formal community early warning systems and early response using gender responsive and inclusive approaches.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
